# Layer A form: netConnect("db.internal", 5432) with an explicit
# EffectDecl at the call site, under a Handler intercepting connectFx
# that returns handle 7; program adds 1 -> 8. The prelude netConnect
# carries Q-039 projections (host -> ArgRef(0), port -> ArgRef(1)),
# so the EffectDecl must reference the SAME host/port nodes the
# application consumes, in category parameter order. Uses the prelude
# netConnect/connectFx (required for the projection semantics) and
# prelude stringT/intT/add; literals and the handle lambda are
# explicit.
@v=1 root=outer
host STR "db.internal"
port ILT 5432
cd EFD connectFx [host port]
callConnect APP netConnect [host port] [] [cd]
one ILT 1
addOne APP add [callConnect one]
h PRC "h" stringT
p PRC "p" intT
seven ILT 7
handleLam LAM [h p] seven
outer H connectFx handleLam addOne
